+ * |   The binary format of the tree       |
+ * -----------------------------------------
+ * -----------------------------------------  --
+ * |    centroid-x-coord (4 bytes)         |    |
+ * -----------------------------------------    |
+ * |    centroid-y-coord (4 bytes)         |    |
+ * -----------------------------------------    |
+ * |    DimensionalShapeType (1 byte)      |    | Centroid-related header
+ * -----------------------------------------    |
+ * |  Sum of weights (VLong 1-8 bytes)     |    |
+ * -----------------------------------------  --
+ * |         Extent (var-encoding)         |
+ * -----------------------------------------
+ * |         Triangle Tree                 |
+ * -----------------------------------------
+ * -----------------------------------------
+ */
